  unitName: World Tree Altro
  unitId: 30113
  unitNumber: 142
  description: When Great Tree Alneu has lived for more than 10,000 years, it transforms
    into the World Tree, Altro. Basically immortal, Altro, who has been around since
    the beginning of time, is also known as the world's eldest being. Some search
    for Altro looking to solve the world's most difficult problems, but since it
    lives deep inside a secluded area, most get discouraged from looking for it.
  summonDesc: Justice for all creation.<br>If you are virtuous, little one,<br>I
    shall be your shield.<br>
  fusionDesc: My roots are soaked <br>in delicious nutrients.<br>I should bear good
    fruit...
  evoDesc: All the world ever was or<br>ever will be is where my <br>power comes
    from.
  element: 3
  rarity: 3
